Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":274,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1908440,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":285616,"Name":"Nickkifu84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285616.jpg?_r=1450820091","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1450348079,"LastPoster":{"Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1908440,"PostDate":1450348079,"PostContent":"Hi everyone! \u00a0 We are planning a DW in Tuscany and things are getting a bit out of hand.\u00a0 \u00a0 I wan...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"fuqua_nikole@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.89.58.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1450347508,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285616.jpg?_r=1450820091","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Nickkifu84","Id":285616,"Name":"Nickkifu84","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.89.58.121","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79798,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2b93802221e87aa8d7294a33a8c8444c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are planning a DW in Tuscany and things are getting a bit out of hand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I want to keep the list to 30-40, but FH is having issues with excluding friends and family.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We have went through several rounds of elimination and can&#039;t seem to get the list below 150&amp;nbsp; :(&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any suggestions for trimming back?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-N&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908440,"PostDate":1450348079,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are planning a DW in Tuscany and things are getting a bit out of hand.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I want to keep the list to 30-40, but FH is having issues with excluding friends and family.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have went through several rounds of elimination and can't seem to get the list below 150\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any suggestions for trimming back?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-N<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"fuqua_nikole@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.89.58.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1450347508,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285616.jpg?_r=1450820091","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Nickkifu84","Id":285616,"Name":"Nickkifu84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.163.219.226","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79798,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac8271be5dc4441e96cfc1a9a56df7f3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;cutting more than 100 guests is a lot! &amp;nbsp;good luck! &amp;nbsp;How many of those people are family? &amp;nbsp;one thing to consider is how many you think will actually come. &amp;nbsp;I let my mom invite as many of her friends as she wanted because i figured out of all of them maybe one couple would come and that wouldn&#039;t put me over the top. &amp;nbsp;As it turns out none of her friends came and she and my dad hosted a party for us after the wedding in their home town and invited all their friends. &amp;nbsp;It worked out great. &amp;nbsp;You could also consider having a local party somewhere. &amp;nbsp;hope you can figure it out - Tuscany sounds amazing! congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908441,"PostDate":1450349604,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>cutting more than 100 guests is a lot! \u00a0good luck! \u00a0How many of those people are family? \u00a0one thing to consider is how many you think will actually come. \u00a0I let my mom invite as many of her friends as she wanted because i figured out of all of them maybe one couple would come and that wouldn't put me over the top. \u00a0As it turns out none of her friends came and she and my dad hosted a party for us after the wedding in their home town and invited all their friends. \u00a0It worked out great. \u00a0You could also consider having a local party somewhere. \u00a0hope you can figure it out - Tuscany sounds amazing! congrats!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"howard.tracyann@gmail.com","IpAddress":"209.163.219.226","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399396256,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277868.jpg?_r=1400085061","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tracyannhoward","Id":277868,"Name":"tracyannhoward","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79798,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c5ad0763285de6fd5ac53a8d5b97cf46","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Nickkifu84\" post=\"1908440\" timestamp=\"1450366079\"]\nHi everyone!\n\nWe are planning a DW in Tuscany and things are getting a bit out of hand. \n\nI want to keep the list to 30-40, but FH is having issues with excluding friends and family. \n\nWe have went through several rounds of elimination and can&#039;t seem to get the list below 150  :(\n\nAny suggestions for trimming back?\n\nThanks!\n\n-N[\/quote]@[member=\"Nickkifu84\"] congrats on choosing to have a Destination wedding.  All friends and family have a role in your life. the big question,you might want to ask yourself is the importance of that role. For example when last did he communicate with his friends?  Sometimes you just have to explain to friends that , you are choosing to have a really super small wedding. People do understand.     \n\nHappy Planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1908446,"PostDate":1450385023,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Nickkifu84, on 17 December 2015 - 10:27 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi everyone!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are planning a DW in Tuscany and things are getting a bit out of hand.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I want to keep the list to 30-40, but FH is having issues with excluding friends and family.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have went through several rounds of elimination and can't seem to get the list below 150\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any suggestions for trimming back?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-N<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285616\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285616-nickkifu84\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Nickkifu84<\/span><\/a> congrats on choosing to have a Destination wedding. \u00a0All friends and family have a role in your life. the big question,you might want to ask yourself is the importance of that role. For example when last did he communicate with his friends? \u00a0Sometimes you just have to explain to friends that , you are choosing to have a really super small wedding. People do understand. \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326836387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.0.142.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79798,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 18 December 2015 - 03:21 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1450452110,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"19f38973fb8190b0c464c16e61c97db9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community Nikkifu84 and Congrats on your upcoming Tuscany wedding - WOW!!! sounds amazing :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ve come to the right place for great ideas, suggestions, advice and support from everyone here - as you can already see :) Wishing you happy research, and all the best with scaling back your guest list to a number that works for you.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some additional inspiration, here are a few magical wedding moments that matter we captured in our beautiful Mayan Riviera .....enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150344652834487.362195.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Timeline Photos Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/12194594_10153720511309487_8212918459677470835_o.jpghttps:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/12194594_10153720511309487_8212918459677470835_o.jpg\" alt=\"12194594_10153720511309487_8212918459677\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/12095280_10153678336124487_5188646533410676333_o.jpg\" alt=\"12095280_10153678336124487_5188646533410\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/11703539_10153437907824487_2769062777116999147_o.jpg\" alt=\"11703539_10153437907824487_2769062777116\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you all the best with your plans and a very Merry Christmas and Happy New Year - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908476,"PostDate":1450450846,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community Nikkifu84 and Congrats on your upcoming Tuscany wedding - WOW!!! sounds amazing <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You've come to the right place for great ideas, suggestions, advice and support from everyone here - as you can already see <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Wishing you happy research, and all the best with scaling back your guest list to a number that works for you.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some additional inspiration, here are a few magical wedding moments that matter we captured in our beautiful Mayan Riviera .....enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....taken from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150344652834487.362195.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Timeline Photos Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/12194594_10153720511309487_8212918459677470835_o.jpghttps:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/12194594_10153720511309487_8212918459677470835_o.jpg\" alt=\"12194594_10153720511309487_8212918459677\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/12095280_10153678336124487_5188646533410676333_o.jpg\" alt=\"12095280_10153678336124487_5188646533410\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/11703539_10153437907824487_2769062777116999147_o.jpg\" alt=\"11703539_10153437907824487_2769062777116\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you all the best with your plans and a very Merry Christmas and Happy New Year - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79798","Title":"Too Many Darn Guests","LastPostDate":1450450846},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
